---

This package contains code derived from dsh-compaction-vcc
(https://github.com/tingfeng-droid/dsh-compaction-vcc, MIT), which in turn
derives from dsh-compaction-instant by TsFreddie (MIT). The derived files live
in lib/vcc/ and keep their original notices:

  lib/vcc/engine.js         <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/index.js
  lib/vcc/compiler.js       <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/compiler.js
  lib/vcc/region.js         <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/region.js
  lib/vcc/session-compat.js <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/session-compat.js
  lib/vcc/preset-check.js   <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/preset-check.js
  lib/vcc/shadow-check.js   <- dsh-compaction-vcc src/shadow-check.js
